<div class="welcome-row"><div><div class="form-kicker">PLANEJAMENTO MENSAL</div><h1>Orçamentos</h1><p class="page-subtitle">Defina limites por categoria e acompanhe o que já foi gasto.</p></div></div>
<?php if($errors): ?><div class="alert error"><?=e(implode(' ',$errors))?></div><?php endif; ?>
<form class="budget-month-filter panel" method="get" action="/budgets"><label>Mês de referência<input type="month" name="month" value="<?=e($month)?>"></label><button class="button secondary">Ver mês</button><span>Alertas são exibidos ao atingir cada percentual configurado.</span></form>
<div class="budget-grid"><?php foreach($budgets as $budget): $bar=min(100,max(0,$budget['used_percent'])); ?><article class="panel budget-card <?=$budget['is_active']?'':'budget-inactive'?>"><div class="budget-card-head"><span class="budget-category-color" style="background:<?=e($budget['is_active']?'#168b68':'#aab3bd')?>"></span><div><strong><?=e($budget['name'])?></strong><small><?=e($budget['category_name'])?> · <?=e($budget['reference_month'])?></small></div><span class="status-pill <?=$budget['is_active']?'received':'cancelled'?>"><?=$budget['is_active']?'Ativo':'Arquivado'?></span></div><div class="budget-values"><strong><?=money((int)$budget['spent'])?></strong><span>de <?=money((int)$budget['limit_amount'])?></span></div><div class="budget-progress <?=$budget['is_over']?'is-over':''?>"><i style="width:<?=$bar?>%"></i></div><div class="budget-caption"><span><?=$budget['used_percent']?>% utilizado</span><span><?php if($budget['is_over']): ?>Ultrapassou <?=money((int)$budget['over_amount'])?><?php else: ?>Restam <?=money((int)$budget['remaining'])?><?php endif; ?></span></div>
<?php if($budget['is_active']&&$budget['reached_alerts']): ?><div class="budget-alert <?=$budget['is_over']?'danger':''?>"><?php if($budget['is_over']): ?>Limite ultrapassado.<?php else: ?>Alerta atingido: <?=e(implode('% · ',$budget['reached_alerts']))?>%.<?php endif; ?></div><?php endif; ?><div class="budget-actions"><a href="/budgets?month=<?=e($month)?>&edit=<?=(int)$budget['id']?>#budget-form">Editar</a><form method="post" action="/budgets/toggle"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<?=e(csrf_token())?>"><input type="hidden" name="id" value="<?=(int)$budget['id']?>"><input type="hidden" name="month" value="<?=e($month)?>"><button><?=$budget['is_active']?'Arquivar':'Reativar'?></button></form></div></article><?php endforeach; ?><?php if(!$budgets): ?><div class="empty-account"><span class="empty-icon">◎</span><strong>Nenhum orçamento em <?=e($month)?></strong><p>Crie um limite para uma categoria e acompanhe as despesas efetivadas.</p></div><?php endif; ?></div>
<section class="panel editor-panel" id="budget-form"><div class="panel-head"><div><h3><?=$edit?'Editar orçamento':'Novo orçamento'?></h3><p>Despesas pagas e parcelas de cartão são contabilizadas no mês selecionado.</p></div></div><?php if(!$categories): ?><div class="inline-note">Cadastre ou ative uma categoria de despesa primeiro. <a href="/categories">Gerenciar categorias</a></div><?php else: ?><form method="post" action="/budgets/save" class="data-form"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<?=e(csrf_token())?>"><input type="hidden" name="id" value="<?=(int)($edit['id']??0)?>"><label>Nome<input name="name" maxlength="80" required value="<?=e($edit['name']??'')?>" placeholder="Ex.: Alimentação"></label><label>Categoria<select name="category_id" required><?php foreach($categories as $category): ?><option value="<?=(int)$category['id']?>" <?=($edit['category_id']??'')==$category['id']?'selected':''?>><?=e($category['name'])?></option><?php endforeach; ?></select></label><label>Limite mensal<input name="limit_amount" inputmode="decimal" required value="<?=e(isset($edit['limit_amount'])?money_input((int)$edit['limit_amount']):'')?>" placeholder="0,00"></label><label>Mês de referência<input type="month" name="reference_month" required value="<?=e($edit['reference_month']??$month)?>"></label><label class="span-two">Alertar em (%)<input name="alert_percentages" value="<?=e($edit['alert_percentages']??'50, 80, 100')?>" placeholder="50, 80, 100"><small class="field-hint">Separe os níveis com vírgula. Aceita percentuais acima de 100%.</small></label><div class="form-actions"><button class="button primary">Salvar orçamento</button><?php if($edit): ?><a class="button secondary" href="/budgets?month=<?=e($month)?>">Cancelar</a><?php endif; ?></div></form><?php endif; ?></section>
